--   • metrics       : merge 11 vs 18; compute % pop change & $ income change; keep tracts meeting 1,000-pop rule
--   • pop_rank      : rank tracts by % pop change
--   • inc_rank      : rank tracts by $ income change
--   • final select  : intersect Top-20 lists (conditions 2 & 3)
